    <string name="title_activity_user_guide">User Guide &amp; FAQ</string>
    <string name="guide_hero_title">Responder Help &amp; Guides</string>
    <string name="guide_hero_subtitle">Everything you need to know about setup, permissions, and real-time emergency dispatch alerts</string>
    <string name="guide_ch1_title">1. Setup &amp; Essential Permissions (Samsung / Xiaomi / Pixel)</string>
    <string name="guide_ch1_content">To allow the app to display real-time emergency popups when the device is locked or asleep, 3 core permissions are required:\n\n• Notification Access: Enables detecting dispatch notifications from MDA and United Hatzalah apps.\n• Display Over Other Apps (Overlay): Essential to popup the emergency alert over active screens.\n• Location (GPS): Calculates accurate distance and estimated travel time (ETA) to the incident.\n\nImportant tip for Samsung and Xiaomi devices:\nSet this app\'s battery usage to \"Unrestricted\" in system settings so background listening is never put to sleep.</string>
    <string name="guide_ch2_title">2. Receiving Dispatch Alerts &amp; Navigation</string>
    <string name="guide_ch2_content">When a new incident arrives:\n• An alert tone sounds and a high-contrast emergency card pops up.\n• United Hatzalah calls appear in Orange, MDA calls in Red.\n• The header displays the City and Street alongside precise distance and ETA.\n• Tap \'Acknowledge\' or \'Open App\' to immediately launch the corresponding dispatch app.</string>
    <string name="guide_ch3_title">3. Custom Sounds, Day/Night &amp; Sabbath Mode</string>
    <string name="guide_ch3_content">In Settings, you can:\n• Choose distinct alert tones for MDA, United Hatzalah, and administrative messages.\n• Set repeat cycles (1, 2, 3 or continuous loop).\n• Configure Night hours for vibrate-only or softened alerts.\n• Enable Sabbath mode for automatic popup dismissal after set seconds without touch.</string>
    <string name="guide_ch4_title">4. Medical Calculators &amp; Utilities</string>
    <string name="guide_ch4_content">Access essential clinical tools in the Tools section:\n• Vitals Ranges: Age-specific normal heart rate, blood pressure, and respiratory ranges.\n• APGAR Score: Rapid newborn evaluation.\n• Glasgow Coma Scale (GCS): Consciousness assessment.\n• Oxygen Calculator: Remaining tank duration based on pressure and LPM flow.\n• Contraction Timer: Interval and duration tracker for labor.\n• CPR Metronome: 110 BPM rhythm for high-quality chest compressions.\n• Medical dictionary and protocols.</string>
    <string name="guide_ch5_title">5. FAQ &amp; Troubleshooting</string>
    <string name="guide_ch5_content">Q: The popup does not appear on call?\nA: Verify that \'Background Listening\' is active (Green), and ensure \'Display over apps\' and Notification Access are granted.\n\nQ: No sound when phone is on silent?\nA: In Sound Settings, turn off \'Alert by device status\' so emergency sirens override silent mode.\n\nQ: How do I switch language?\nA: Go to Settings > Language to switch between Hebrew, English, and Arabic.</string>
